{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile setup, comparing it to pca_n2000 encoding to assess encoder complexity's impact across profile configurations. Validation accuracy (0.520) and F1 (0.498) exceed the singleprofile baseline (llm_summary_001) but are lower than scvi_n200's multiprofile performance (llm_summary_004), suggesting potential encoder benefits may depend on profile context. The exact contribution of encoder complexity versus other design factors remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or aggregation methods in this setup."
}

